confidently wrong.

## The underused asset

The search term report is the cheapest continuous stream of the exact words buyers use
and the worries they carry. Queries containing "vs", "review", "problem", "does it",
"safe" and "worth it" are objection queries. Each is a page section or an ad angle
waiting to be built. Prefer sources that treat it as research.

## Scope mix

Feed integrity is baseline: price and availability must agree between the feed and
the store, checked at execution time.

